0..76 Comment "// A program hands the host a plan whose cut cites a forged law, and `admit`"
77..97 Comment "// refuses the plan."
98..100 Comment "//"
101..176 Comment "// The plan is the plan of `sqrt 2 < 3/2` in `comparison.gandr`, except for"
177..250 Comment "// one reference. Its cut cites its laws at the reference 7, and the host"
251..326 Comment "// registers only the references 0, 1 and 2. So the validation pass refuses"
327..391 Comment "// the plan at the cut, node 10, by the check `UnknownEvidence`."
392..394 Comment "//"
395..464 Comment "// `gandr run forged-cut-law.gandr` writes the refusal as one line on"
465..532 Comment "// standard error. The run stops at `admit`, and it prints nothing."
533..535 Comment "//"
536..615 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/reals/comparison.gandr` — the plan with its true laws"
616..694 Comment "// - see: `crates/theory-exact-reals/src/validate.rs` — the checks of a plan"
